### \uc0\u55357 \u56524  B\u431 \u7898 C 1: L\u7845 y M\'e3 \u272 o L\u432 \u7901 ng (Measurement ID) t\u7915  Google Analytics 4\
\
1. Truy c\uc0\u7853 p v\'e0o **[Google Analytics](https://analytics.google.com/)** v\'e0 \u273 \u259 ng nh\u7853 p b\u7857 ng t\'e0i kho\u7843 n Gmail c\u7911 a b\u7841 n.\
2. N\uc0\u7871 u ch\u432 a c\'f3 t\'e0i kho\u7843 n GA4:\
   - Nh\uc0\u7845 n **B\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u \u273 o l\u432 \u7901 ng (Start measuring)**.\
   - Nh\uc0\u7853 p **T\'ean t\'e0i kho\u7843 n** (v\'ed d\u7909 : `Tam B\u7843 o Health`).\
   - Nh\uc0\u7853 p **T\'ean thu\u7897 c t\'ednh (Property name)**: `Tam Bao Web App`.\
   - Ch\uc0\u7885 n M\'fai gi\u7901 : **Vi\u7879 t Nam (GMT+7)** v\'e0 Ti\u7873 n t\u7879 : **Vi\u7879 t Nam \u272 \u7891 ng (VND)**.\
3. Ch\uc0\u7885 n lu\u7891 ng d\u7919  li\u7879 u (Data Stream):\
   - Ch\uc0\u7885 n n\u7873 n t\u7843 ng l\'e0 **Web**.\
   - Nh\uc0\u7853 p **URL trang web** c\u7911 a b\u7841 n (v\'ed d\u7909 : `https://tambao.yourdomain.com` ho\u7863 c t\u7841 m \u273 \u7875  `localhost`).\
   - Nh\uc0\u7853 p **T\'ean lu\u7891 ng**: `Tam Bao App`.\
   - B\uc0\u7845 m **T\u7841 o lu\u7891 ng (Create stream)**.\
4. Sau khi t\uc0\u7841 o xong, m\'e0n h\'ecnh s\u7869  hi\u7875 n th\u7883  **Chi ti\u7871 t lu\u7891 ng Web (Web stream details)**.\
5. T\'ecm m\uc0\u7909 c **M\'c3 \u272 O L\u431 \u7900 NG (MEASUREMENT ID)** \u7903  g\'f3c tr\'ean b\'ean ph\u7843 i (c\'f3 \u273 \u7883 nh d\u7841 ng b\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u b\u7857 ng ch\u7919  `G-`, v\'ed d\u7909 : `G-3X9K8L7M2N`). **H\'e3y sao ch\'e9p (copy) m\'e3 n\'e0y.**\
\
