### \uc0\u55357 \u56524  B\u431 \u7898 C 2: D\'e1n M\'e3 GA4 V\'e0o Web App `index.html`\
\
1. M\uc0\u7903  file [index.html](file:///Users/user/My%20Drive/Obsidian/Obsidian%20Vault%20%28thanglongit%29/04%20-%20KINH%20DOANH/TamBao-App/index.html).\
2. T\'ecm \uc0\u273 \u7871 n kho\u7843 ng d\'f2ng **37 - 44** (trong th\u7867  `<head>`):\
\
```html\
<!-- Google Analytics 4 (GA4) -->\
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-XXXXXXXXXX"></script>\
<script>\
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\
  function gtag() \{ dataLayer.push(arguments); \}\
  gtag('js', new Date());\
\
  // H\uc0\u431 \u7898 NG D\u7850 N: Thay 'G-XXXXXXXXXX' b\u7857 ng m\'e3 GA4 th\u7921 c t\u7871  c\u7911 a b\u7841 n\
  const GA_MEASUREMENT_ID = 'G-3X9K8L7M2N'; // <--- S\uc0\u7916 A T\u7840 I 2 D\'d2NG N\'c0Y\
\
  if (GA_MEASUREMENT_ID !== 'G-XXXXXXXXXX') \{\
    gtag('config', GA_MEASUREMENT_ID);\
  \}\
</script>\
```\
3. Thay c\uc0\u7843  2 v\u7883  tr\'ed `G-XXXXXXXXXX` (\u7903  d\'f2ng `src="..."` v\'e0 d\'f2ng `const GA_MEASUREMENT_ID = '...'`) th\'e0nh m\'e3 `G-` th\u7921 c t\u7871  b\u7841 n v\u7915 a l\u7845 y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c.\
