### \uc0\u55357 \u56524  B\u431 \u7898 C 3: C\'e1c S\u7921  Ki\u7879 n Ph\u7877 u (Events) \u272 \u432 \u7907 c Theo D\'f5i T\u7921  \u272 \u7897 ng\
\
M\'e3 ngu\uc0\u7891 n Web App **\u273 \'e3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'e0i \u273 \u7863 t s\u7861 n** c\'e1c h\'e0m t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng b\u7855 n s\u7921  ki\u7879 n v\u7873  GA4 theo t\u7915 ng b\u432 \u7899 c c\u7911 a kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng m\'e0 b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng c\u7847 n ph\u7843 i vi\u7871 t th\'eam code:\
\
| T\'ean S\uc0\u7921  Ki\u7879 n trong GA4 | H\'e0nh Vi Kh\'e1ch H\'e0ng K\'edch Ho\u7841 t | \'dd Ngh\u297 a Trong Ph\u7877 u |\
| :--- | :--- | :--- |\
| `begin_assessment` | B\uc0\u7845 m n\'fat "B\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 ngay" tr\'ean Trang ch\u7911  | Kh\'e1ch b\u432 \u7899 c v\'e0o ph\u7877 u |\
| `start_questions` | Nh\uc0\u7853 p xong H\u7885  t\'ean/N\u259 m sinh v\'e0 chuy\u7875 n sang l\'e0m test | Kh\'e1ch b\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u tr\u7843  l\u7901 i 18 c\'e2u |\
| `complete_assessment` | Tr\uc0\u7843  l\u7901 i xong c\'e2u 18 v\'e0 b\u7845 m "Xem b\'e1o c\'e1o" | Ho\'e0n th\'e0nh l\'e0m test |\
| `view_paywall` | M\uc0\u7903  m\'e0n h\'ecnh Preview 4 trang + B\u7843 ng gi\'e1 99k | Kh\'e1ch ti\u7871 p c\u7853 n trang b\'e1n h\'e0ng |\
| `show_exit_intent` | R\'ea chu\uc0\u7897 t \u273 \u7883 nh tho\'e1t trang l\'e0m n\u7843 y Popup \u432 u \u273 \'e3i 69k | Gi\u7919  ch\'e2n kh\'e1ch r\u7901 i ph\u7877 u |\
| `begin_checkout` | B\uc0\u7845 m n\'fat "T\'f4i \u273 \'e3 chuy\u7875 n kho\u7843 n" / M\u7903  form \u273 i\u7873 n S\u272 T Zalo | Kh\'e1ch chu\u7849 n b\u7883  tr\u7843  ti\u7873 n |\
| `purchase` | \uc0\u272 i\u7873 n xong S\u272 T Zalo v\'e0 chuy\u7875 n sang trang C\u7843 m \u417 n | **Chuy\u7875 n \u273 \u7893 i th\'e0nh c\'f4ng!** |\
