### \uc0\u55357 \u56524  B\u431 \u7898 C 4: Ki\u7875 m Tra Nhanh Xem GA4 \u272 \'e3 Nh\u7853 n S\u7921  Ki\u7879 n Ch\u432 a\
\
1. M\uc0\u7903  trang Google Analytics \u8594  Ch\u7885 n m\u7909 c **B\'e1o c\'e1o (Reports)** \u8594  **Th\u7901 i gian th\u7921 c (Realtime)**.\
